nvcjk###
@base = https://localhost:7130
@orderId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 1. Stock dekhein (200, quantity 5)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/inventory/PHONE-001

### 2. Reserve karein 2 (200)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/inventory/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "items": [ { "sku": "PHONE-001", "quantity": 2 } ]
}

### 3. Stock dekhein (quantity 3)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/inventory/PHONE-001

### 4. Same reserve dobara (idempotent, quantity abhi bhi 3)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/inventory/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "items": [ { "sku": "PHONE-001", "quantity": 2 } ]
}

### 5. Stock check (quantity 3)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/inventory/PHONE-001

### 6. Release karein (200)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/inventory/reservations/{{orderId}}/release

### 7. Stock check (quantity 5)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/inventory/PHONE-001

### 8. Insufficient stock (409)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/inventory/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "items": [ { "sku": "PHONE-001", "quantity": 99 } ]
}
